{
  "about": "The bank of wish icons (L09 v6): the names the Djinn chooses a wish's icon from, and their drawings, on a 24 grid with round caps and joins. line: the fine stroke, at lineStroke, in the duo's first colour; filigree: finer, at filigreeStroke, the same colour; gilding: the illuminations, mostly filled, in the duo's second colour. duo: S emerald and saffron, L saffron and emerald, E ink and saffron, M ink and mint; the colours are tokens of src/review.css (--wi-*), never here. en and fr: the words a search reads, in English and in French. No id in any drawing. Our own drawings: no third-party licence.",
